  "version": "1.0.1",
  "notes": "**A faster nuza.** Opening, switching, creating, renaming and deleting notes now take a frame or two, in vaults of any size.\n\n## Faster\n\n- **Switching notes** is up to four times faster. Each switch used to check every link in the vault against every note, and to restyle the whole window.\n- **Creating, renaming and opening folders** no longer wait behind nuza's background scan of the vault. A rename could take three seconds in a large vault; it now takes a fraction of a second.\n- **Deleting** is instant, the first time in a session too.\n- **The AI panel** no longer slows typing or switching when it holds a long chat.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- A tab could be left faded, with a bar beside it, after a drag.\n- New files and folders go where you'd expect: into the folder selected in the sidebar, or beside the selected note, as in VS Code. A folder you have just made is where the next note goes.\n- The chat list in the AI panel is clearer: grouped by day, with the note each chat was about, a search once there are many, and a second press to delete.",
